### One more critical thing (you mentioned it, but it’s NOT implemented)

You wrote: *“we will turn warmPinned off before Stage2”* — but your code **never does it**, so flexible stays pinned forever.

Put this **between Stage1 and Stage2**:

```java
// ---- Release warm pins before Stage2 ----
if (best1.seats != null) {
    for (CrewSeat s : best1.seats) {
        if (s != null && s.warmPinned) {
            s.warmPinned = false;
            // optionally clear these so it becomes fully free:
            s.pinnedWid = null;
            s.pinnedStart = null;
            s.pinnedDays = null;
            s.pinnedHours = null;
        }
    }
}
```

If you want: “Stage2 may change employee, but keep dates/hours as a hint”, then don’t clear pinnedStart/days/hours—only set `warmPinned=false`.

